{"version":1,"content":"<p>紐約當地時間周四（11月19日）上午，美國人工智能公司Anthropic在紐約納斯達克交易所舉行首次公開募股（IPO）敲鐘儀式，股票代碼為「ANT」。納斯達克位於紐約時代廣場的巨型電子屏幕直播了Anthropic的敲鐘儀式，公司代表及嘉賓共同出席，現場響起掌聲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587132.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:28.871549+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:09:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.255254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.255254+00:00","content_hash":"fadd10ab67439eb2407bfbdee811d5d791849bf9f07b26f288c08c1ae3c91513","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}